                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]Reviewed using HTC Vive Pro[/h1]\nRise Kraken reclaim the sea rid mother earth of this human disease, surprise above or below, crush ye scallywags with deadly blows 🐙 Aaaarrrrgggghhhh!\n\n✔️$1.99 delivers a good workout cause Kraken' Ain't Easy ⛱️\n\nI did cheat-a-little[spoiler]during the Height Calibration I used a step stool to stand on.  So I was higher up than the game would set for me.[/spoiler] My head was above water instead of head & shoulders above water level.  Made bending in the water easier for me and less pain in my back❗ \n\n✔️Great Graphics has excellent music & audio  \n✔️This 3 Chapter Kraken action keeps you engaged   \n✔️Strategy, Cunning & Timing plus Fit Body 💪\n❌ Pre swallow 2 of these💊💊 if your older like me.\n\nAfter all your the Mighty Sea \"KRAKEN 🐙\"\nhttps://youtu.be/dyte3HE-yD4",
